          "gap": 6,
          "padding": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aDphr",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What the checker enforces on every bun test (scripts/inventory-check.ts, 32 tests, one mutant per rule)",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "500"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PU4Yv",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  A live feature is on a page or run by a loop, and has an interface; it never depends on something retired.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bZvAz",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  Need is reserved for the three holds: Ask, Approval, Owner step (A1).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i8oDGk",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  A live page belongs to a feature, has a Pen frame and its export, and touches no retired interface. A kept page with no frame says so and a finding tracks it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "oLM0r",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  A live component is used by a live page; usage is derived, never stored twice.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aMVAI",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  Every live interface has a handling layer and a caller. Owner gate verbs are callable only from you, through the surface.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "mgGRF",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  Only a lane may handle an interface that launches a session, and only conductor or lane loops may call one (A8).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NQQzM",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  A store is written only by its owning layer; two writer modules need an exception with a ticket.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qIXXz",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  Every finding is about real ids; blockers and majors carry a ticket. Cited code paths exist.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "n6ofK",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "·  Ids carry their section prefix; statuses come from one vocabulary; an unknown key fails (a comma in a YAML flow mapping).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
