                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Softer material: 16 px radius, a hairline border and a 1–4 px shadow in place of S1's heavy outlines. The Ask in Decide opens in place with a spring; answering shows an undo capsule for 8 s. Press feedback fires on pointer-down.",
