                  "content": "Maestro's rows in Paseo's sidebar and the presence footer. Maestro takes the window; its top header holds the tabs (a segmented control), the workspace filter (open here), presence, the next wake, search and New work. Also gone: the single column and the implementation tags drawn in the UI.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
