          "fill": "$fg",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "S1 had the information, H1 had the feel. Four variations keep S1's density and broomva-design, put navigation in an Apple-style top header instead of Paseo's sidebar, and take only the glass touches a Paseo plugin can build.",
