          "name": "t",
          "fill": "$fg-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "J1 is the safest step from S1 (today's cards restyled); J3 is the densest and the furthest from a dashboard; J4 draws the recommendation. Item counts are as drawn in a 1440 × 1080 window. Feel claims stay unverified until built.",
